Comment: 0,0:02:14.32,0:02:16.18,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,全神貫注
Comment: 0,0:02:16.18,0:02:23.10,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,保持警惕 直到你看見真實世界
Comment: 0,0:02:23.10,0:02:25.34,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,抓住機會
Comment: 0,0:02:25.34,0:02:29.36,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,直到你終結遊戲 答案才會浮現
Comment: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:32.32,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,你必須親自出馬
Comment: 0,0:02:33.95,0:02:35.49,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,是時候覺醒了
Comment: 0,0:02:35.49,0:02:41.25,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,是時候去尋找被隱藏至深的真相
Comment: 0,0:02:41.25,0:02:45.38,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,你準備好倒數計時了嗎
Comment: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:48.00,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,你知道未來無定數
Comment: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:53.88,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,但我們的選擇至關重要
Comment: 0,0:02:54.59,0:02:57.50,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,前路漫漫 未來似乎不堪一擊
Comment: 0,0:02:57.50,0:03:04.98,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,真相也只會讓你窒息
Comment: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:17.70,Screen,,0,0,0,,=== OPEN ===
Comment: 1,0:02:14.32,0:02:16.18,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Open up your senses
Comment: 1,0:02:16.18,0:02:23.10,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Keep your guard up 'till you see the real world
Comment: 1,0:02:23.10,0:02:25.34,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Gotta take your chances
Comment: 1,0:02:25.34,0:02:29.36,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,You won't find your answers 'till you end the game
Comment: 1,0:02:29.36,0:02:32.32,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,With your own hands
Comment: 1,0:02:33.95,0:02:35.49,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's about time we wake up
Comment: 1,0:02:35.49,0:02:41.25,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Time we start to see the truth hidden beneath
Comment: 1,0:02:41.25,0:02:45.38,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Are you ready for the countdown
Comment: 1,0:02:45.40,0:02:48.00,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,You see the future's never certain
Comment: 1,0:02:48.04,0:02:53.88,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,But it's governed by the choices that we make
Comment: 1,0:02:54.59,0:02:57.50,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,You're standing on a fragile future
Comment: 1,0:02:57.50,0:03:04.98,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,And the truth will take your breath away
Comment: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:17.70,Screen,,0,0,0,,=== END ===
